## Integration acceptance

- Every claimed pass links to an executed result for its stated revision and method; new examples require their own build/browser checks.
- Every matrix row is exercised or explicitly not tested for a release, with unresolved failures retained.
- User-facing accessibility statements distinguish documentation, maintained fixture controls, native tasks and physical device outcomes.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

